  "releaseNotes": "- Unified UDP and TCP transport logic for better consistency.\n      - Added high-performance processing loops for faster UDP throughput.\n      - Optimized memory usage and resource cleanup order for stability.\n      - Simplified UdpSession architecture for cleaner, more robust API usage.\n      - Improved async I/O handling and internal state management.\n      - Enhanced maintainability by removing redundant code.",
